<title>JAPAN: Asahi Bank says will change president.</title>
<headline>Asahi Bank says will change president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Bank Ltd said on Tuesday it will hold a news conference at 2.30 pm (0530 GMT) to announce a change of its president.</p>
<p>The current president is Shigehiko Yoshino.</p>
</text>
